+Each outer request variant delegates to one braced payload. Fields in a product
+payload are space-separated; Text containing whitespace is curly-quoted.
+Optional locations are `None` or `Some.{ <path> }`.
+
+Adding operator behavior means declaring a request and paired response in
+`ethos/clavifaber.ethos`, regenerating `src/generated/clavifaber.rs` with the
+pinned Ethos generator, and implementing that generated request's `execute()`
+in `src/request.rs`. Do not hand-maintain Datom implementations.
 
